# No environment variables or secrets are required.
#
# - Claude Code uses your own login (claude.ai account, or ANTHROPIC_API_KEY exported in
#   your shell if you use the API). Nothing in this repo reads a .env file.
# - Both MCP servers (Microsoft Learn, Context7) are remote and keyless.
# - Models are pinned in .claude/settings.json (session) and in each agent's frontmatter;
#   override the session model per user in .claude/settings.local.json (git-ignored).
